  "weekLabel": "Week of Nov 2–6, 2026",
  "headline": "Quiet week before Anthropic: OPay pulled its priced IPO, and Anthropic's debut is targeted for the week of Nov 16",
  "summary": "The calendar for Nov 2–6 is light: BayCoast Bank holding company Narragansett Bancorp (NARA) starts trading Monday after a $91M offering at $10, Football Manager SPAC (FBLLU) plans a $100M listing, and IPOScoop still lists Bitari (BIAI, unconfirmed). Renaissance says dental company vVardis (VVVV) and spinal implant maker Centinel Spine (CNTL) could launch despite the AI sell-off. Anthropic filed its public S-1 on Oct 26 for a Nasdaq listing as ANT; Renaissance estimates $75B or more, with a roadshow as soon as Nov 9–10 and a debut reported for the week of Nov 16 (no price range yet). Last week OPay priced at $19 (bottom of range, $304M) but withdrew before trading on Oct 30, citing a foreign regulatory inquiry. Bambusa (BBTX, -6.3%) and Aspen Neuroscience (ASPE, -0.7%) slipped on Oct 30 debuts, while Georgia Banking Company (GBC) direct-listed and finished 27.9% above its last private round. Lycia (LYCA) has cooled from +66.7% on day one to +46.7%. Renaissance's IPO Index was up 11.1% YTD vs the S&P 500's 13.8% as of Oct 29.",
  "highlights": [
    {
      "text": "Anthropic (ANT, Nasdaq) filed its public S-1 Oct 26; Renaissance estimates $75B+ and a debut is reported for the week of Nov 16",
      "unconfirmed": true,
      "note": "Timing reported, no terms filed"
    },
    {
      "text": "OPay priced its $304M IPO at $19 then withdrew it before trading on Oct 30, citing a foreign regulatory inquiry",
      "unconfirmed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Narragansett Bancorp (NARA) starts trading Mon, Nov 2 after a $91M offering at $10; Football Manager SPAC (FBLLU) plans $100M",
      "unconfirmed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Oct 30 biotech debuts were soft: Bambusa (BBTX) -6.3%, Aspen Neuroscience (ASPE) -0.7%",
      "unconfirmed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "vVardis and Centinel Spine could launch this week (Renaissance); no terms filed yet",
      "unconfirmed": true,
      "note": "Not scheduled"
    }
  ],
